#show: wanshi

#metadata((
  "title": "Boolean function",
  "taxon": "definition",
  "date": "2026-08-17",
  "description": "A map from the n-dimensional Boolean cube to a single bit.",
))

A #emph[Boolean function] on $n$ variables is a map

$ f: {0,1}^n -> {0,1}. $

The domain ${0,1}^n$ is the #emph[Boolean cube]; a point of it is an assignment
of a bit to each of the $n$ coordinates.
